WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
OK

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:14,660
Four bark leaves

3
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:23,740
For more than twenty-five years, a well-disguised brat has been trampled like this.

4
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,060
Protect with light strips

5
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,820
Dad, this is my second time living in the mountains

6
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:27,900
Who wants to dig up the wild mountain body?

7
00:00:28,020 --> 00:00:28,980
I didn’t bring a wooden box

8
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:31,020
Dad, you don’t remember me, do you?

9
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,420
Don't say twenty-five years

10
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:38,300
I have also seen the fifty-year-old lamp stand.

11
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,430
Huzi, your ability to run mountains is better than that of dad.

12
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,870
I brought the rabbit's nest and rescued the big flower and put on a robe.

13
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,580
How can I talk when I have lifted my old mountain body again?

14
00:00:57,860 --> 00:00:59,100
Still worse than I was back then

15
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:05,620
You can't sell your body to old people

16
00:01:05,620 --> 00:01:07,460
Why did you sell it to Zhou Laoer?

17
00:01:07,980 --> 00:01:09,180
Are you always particular about old food?

18
00:01:09,620 --> 00:01:11,340
Pay attention to return, pay attention to return, agree with Zhou Shen

19
00:01:11,340 --> 00:01:12,500
Can Zhou Laoer give me two hundred more?

20
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:16,020
His eldest brother is the deputy director of a traditional Chinese medicine hospital and has high-end customers for these high-end medicinal materials.

21
00:01:16,020 --> 00:01:17,140
You can make more money by selling it to him.

22
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:18,940
From then on, mountain goods will still sell old rice.

23
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:21,620
Ordinary mountain goods selling old rice

24
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:27,550
Selling high-end medicinal materials, Zhou Lao Er went his own way and happened to pass by the scene.

25
00:01:27,550 --> 00:01:28,510
I'll give you two kilograms of meat

26
00:01:29,790 --> 00:01:31,190
He also said he had no idea about others

27
00:01:43,810 --> 00:01:52,020
People will come later. Call me Lao Ma and Hu Zi.

28
00:01:52,500 --> 00:01:53,460
What good stuff are there today?

29
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:02,870
Two pieces of robe meat, one pound and eighty-six pounds

30
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:06,710
There is a big hole in the leather butt, and the quality is almost thirty

31
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:15,140
How to deal with Hu Zi for a total of 116 yuan?

32
00:02:15,420 --> 00:02:16,620
You have nothing to say about your great hunting skills.

33
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:18,140
Since this is more than a hundred yuan

34
00:02:18,300 --> 00:02:22,420
Last time I talked about borrowing money to buy a gun. Uncle Fan, don’t bother me. I got the money to buy a gun.
